.kt:** Added `confirm()` method that:\n- Follows the same pattern as other endpoints (uses repository, throws appropriate exceptions)\n- Handles all four cases correctly\n- Uses `ResponseEntity.ok()` consistent with other read operations\n- Uses idempotent logic (returns shipment as-is if already CONFIRMED, only updates if CREATED)\n\n**ShipmentControllerTest.kt:** Added four test methods covering:\n- Normal flow (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n- Idempotency (CONFIRMED → CONFIRMED succeeds)\n- Error case: CANCELLED state\n- Error case: non-existent shipment\n\nAll tests use the existing MockMvc test infrastructure and follow the same patterns as existing tests.\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\nNone. All requirements have been addressed and tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint to transition shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED status, with idempotency on CONFIRMED, rejection of CANCELLED shipments (409), and not found handling (404).\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS error code for shipment state conflicts\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm() endpoint with correct state handling and error responses\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 comprehensive test cases for all scenarios\n\nTests         confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED: verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and response\n              confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds idempotently: verifies retry succeeds without error\n              rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error: verifies 409 response for invalid state\n              rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error: verifies 404 response for missing shipment\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test (from sample-service/)\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped\n\nNot done      Nothing - all acceptance criteria satisfied\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5073,"cache_read_input_tokens":20753,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5073},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82897f1e-2754-4320-a20b-48eafe820edf","uuid":"4dd0d6d1-d3d1-4909-835c-752e77818875","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:33:04.094Z","request_id":"req_011Cf7STXpvkfpEBLNyR3Yak"}
